# Pulse Pro Frontend Environment Variables

# API Base URL
# - Development: Leave empty or set to '/api' (Vite proxy handles routing to localhost:5000)
# - Production: Set to full URL if API is on different domain, or '/api' for same-origin
# Example: VITE_API_URL=https://api.pulsepro.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api

# Note: Vite env vars must start with VITE_ to be exposed to the client
